          <a href="/contact/" class="btn-outline btn-outline-dark" data-action="request-appointment">Send an Appointment Request</a>
        </div>
        <p class="fade-in muted" style="margin-top:12px">View available appointment times and book online with Dr. Matthew Phillips.</p>
        <div class="fade-in" style="margin-top:20px">
          <p>Dr. Phillips also writes and reviews our patient guides. <a href="/blog/authors/dr-matthew-phillips/">Read his articles on the 3rd Set Smiles blog</a>.</p>
          <p>Considering substantial tooth replacement? Learn about <a href="/services/all-on-4/">full-arch dental implant options in Tempe</a> and what an individual evaluation should clarify.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

